"publishedAt":"2026-06-11T00:00:00.806Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmq8d8miz01drslldd29j1yzr","https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-study-shows-ai-needs-hours-not-weeks-to-build-exploits-from-security-patches"],"articles":[{"id":"cmq8d8miz01drslldd29j1yzr","title":"Anthropic 研究：AI 数小时内即可从安全补丁构建漏洞利用","originalTitle":"","summary":"Anthropic 安全团队发现，其 Mythos Preview AI 模型能在几小时内将 Firefox 和 Windows 内核的安全补丁转化为可工作的漏洞利用，成本仅需数千美元，且无需专业知识。在微软自动更新到达任何设备之前，该模型已完成 8 条完整攻击链。Anthropic 认为传统的补丁节奏已经过时。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq8d8miz01drslldd29j1yzr","originalUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-study-shows-ai-needs-hours-not-weeks-to-build-exploits-from-security-patches","publishedAt":"2026-06-11T00:00:00.806Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1uslcxv","originalSourceName":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","family":"outlet-ezirzi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq8d8miz01drslldd29j1yzr","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T19:51:46.715Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1uslcxv","name":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-11T19:51:46.715Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Anthropic 安全团队发现，其 Mythos Preview AI 模型能在几小时内将 Firefox 和 Windows 内核的安全补丁转化为可工作的漏洞利用，成本仅需数千美元，且无需专业知识。在微软自动更新到达任何设备之前，该模型已完成 8 条完整攻击链。Anthropic 认为传统的补丁节奏已经过时。","reportEdition":"2026-06-11","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq8f6o8v01weslld6q3q39ne","title":"Google Research提出审计机器遗忘新框架","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-06-11T00:00:00.806Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmq8f6o8v01weslld6q3q39ne","https://research.google/blog/new-framework-for-auditing-machine-unlearning"],"articles":[{"id":"cmq8f6o8v01weslld6q3q39ne","title":"Google Research提出审计机器遗忘新框架","originalTitle":"","summary":"Google Research 在 AISTATS 2026 发表正则化 f-散度核检验，用于高效审计 LLM 等模型的机器遗忘。该方法通过统计两样本检验判断模型是否真正“忘记”特定训练数据，避免完全重训的巨大成本。相比最大均值差异等现有工具，新框架理论上可在任意样本量下自然控制假阳性，且假阴性风险随可用样本增加可靠收敛至零，解决了大规模模型审计中计算成本过高的问题。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq8f6o8v01weslld6q3q39ne","originalUrl":"https://research.google/blog/new-framework-for-auditing-machine-unlearning","publishedAt":"2026-06-11T00:00:00.806Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-u8es94","originalSourceName":"Google Research：Blog（网页）","family":"google","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq8f6o8v01weslld6q3q39ne","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T19:51:46.715Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-u8es94","name":"Google Research：Blog（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-11T19:51:46.715Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Google Research 在 AISTATS 2026 发表正则化 f-散度核检验，用于高效审计 LLM 等模型的机器遗忘。该方法通过统计两样本检验判断模型是否真正“忘记”特定训练数据，避免完全重训的巨大成本。相比最大均值差异等现有工具，新框架理论上可在任意样本量下自然控制假阳性，且假阴性风险随可用样本增加可靠收敛至零，解决了大规模模型审计中计算成本过高的问题。","reportEdition":"2026-06-11","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq7w1nzi028nslepn0azwdsg","title":"百度百舸联合复旦提出LU-KV框架，被ICML 2026录用","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-06-11T00:00:00.806Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmq7w1nzi028nslepn0azwdsg","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oKhawmph49YYPR63T-ekaw"],"articles":[{"id":"cmq7w1nzi028nslepn0azwdsg","title":"百度百舸联合复旦提出LU-KV框架，被ICML 2026录用","originalTitle":"","summary":"百度百舸团队与复旦大学合作提出Long-horizon Utility KV（LU-KV）框架，将头级KV Cache预算分配建模为面向长程边际效用的全局组合优化问题。LU-KV通过离线画像估计注意力头边际贡献曲线，结合凸包松弛与基于边际效用的贪心求解器，在较低开销下得到接近最优的预算配置，可适配SnapKV、KeyDiff等多类压缩方法。在LongBench和RULER基准上，80%压缩比下性能损失小，降低显存占用和推理延迟。相关论文被ICML 2026录用。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq7w1nzi028nslepn0azwdsg","originalUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oKhawmph49YYPR63T-ekaw","publishedAt":"2026-06-11T00:00:00.806Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-76u19w","originalSourceName":"公众号：百度智能云（文心）","family":"outlet-110bbwa","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq7w1nzi028nslepn0azwdsg","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T19:51:46.715Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-76u19w","name":"公众号：百度智能云（文心）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-11T19:51:46.715Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"百度百舸团队与复旦大学合作提出Long-horizon Utility KV（LU-KV）框架，将头级KV Cache预算分配建模为面向长程边际效用的全局组合优化问题。LU-KV通过离线画像估计注意力头边际贡献曲线，结合凸包松弛与基于边际效用的贪心求解器，在较低开销下得到接近最优的预算配置，可适配SnapKV、KeyDiff等多类压缩方法。在LongBench和RULER基准上，80%压缩比下性能损失小，降低显存占用和推理延迟。相关论文被ICML 2026录用。","reportEdition":"2026-06-11","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aiho